# Elefante v2.13.0 release authorization

Authorized: 2026-08-28
Purpose: Publish the governed intelligence product surfaces, Recall-first
customer contract, local intelligence ledgers, integration adapters, and
professional user/developer documentation prepared in PR #25.
Source changes: PR #25

Publication requirements:
- Every maintained version declaration and the dated changelog entry resolve
  to 2.13.0.
- PR #25 quality, dashboard, dependency audit, customer-bundle, and platform
  build gates are green at the exact merge commit before publication.
- The published customer surface contains 17 tools and 2 prompts; the
  developer-only Task Intelligence tool remains default-off.
- Task Intelligence is described as evaluation infrastructure and no
  representative multi-task outcome-lift claim is made.
- Release assets carry release provenance and pass independent SHA-256
  verification after publication.
- Published historical tags remain immutable.
